# Subject + Object Combinations (Cross Product of PS and Ob)
# Generated via script to handle chaining (e.g., Bazilya)
# TO-DO: Run the generation script and replace the line below with the output

# A special group of object markers in words like A"mwe"kutte, Amwekwata, yamwekutte, yamwekwata, anaamwekwata, alimwekwata Ba"gwe"wadde, Baa"ke"fumbidde
